es"},{"text":"Battery degradation"},{"text":"Battery ageing prediction"},{"text":"SOC estimation"},{"text":"SOH estimation"},{"text":"Remaining useful life prediction"},{"text":"Battery thermal management"},{"text":"Thermal runaway prevention"},{"text":"Fast charging"},{"text":"Battery safety"},{"text":"Advanced BMS"},{"text":"AI-based battery diagnostics"},{"text":"Battery digital twins"},{"text":"Second-life batteries"},{"text":"Battery recycling"},{"text":"Battery materials"},{"text":"Cell manufacturing"},{"text":"Grid-scale energy storage"}]},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the role evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"Battery engineering is moving beyond simply selecting cells and calculating pack capacity."},{"type":"p","text":"The future battery engineer will increasingly work across:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Cell","Module","Pack","BMS","Thermal","Vehicle","Charging","Data"]},{"type":"p","text":"AI and advanced modelling will increasingly support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Predictive battery health"},{"text":"Real-time degradation estimation"},{"text":"Fast-charging optimisation"},{"text":"Thermal prediction"},{"text":"Fault prediction"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Battery-life optimisation"},{"text":"Automated battery testing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest long-term profile is therefore:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Battery Engineering","BMS","Embedded Systems","Thermal Engineering","Data/AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Also develop knowledge of battery recycling, second-life applications and alternative chemistries, because the battery ecosystem extends beyond the first life of an EV."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"flow","items":["Automobile","Vehicle Dynamics","EV Architecture","Powertrain"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Battery","Cell Chemistry","Pack Design","Battery Testing","Battery Ageing"]},{"type":"flow","items":["BMS","SOC","SOH","Cell Balancing","Fault Detection","CAN"]},{"type":"flow",